## 7. Conclusion

A Progressive Web Application (PWA) is the best choice for the college canteen food-ordering system because it is affordable, easy to access, and works across multiple devices. It provides important features such as online ordering, secure payments, and push notifications. It also reduces the need to develop separate applications for different platforms.

Thus, implementing a PWA can make the college canteen ordering process faster, easier, and more convenient for both students and canteen staff.
